  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ukraine: Urgent Appeal for Help for Flooded Areas</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The horrifying destruction of Ukraine&apos;s Nova Kakhovka dam on June 6th is potentially an ecological disaster. President Volodymyr Zelenskyy condemned the incident as mass environmental damage. People have died, many have lost their homes, and access to food and water is limited. As floods sweep the region, people need urgent access to essentials! We help affected people access the basics for survival, such as food, water and medicines.</narrative>
  </description>
